cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AO-Fed-IFU-Spectrograph-Simulation"
abstract: >-
  A compact Python simulator for AO-fed integral-field spectroscopy: source
  datacube generation, AO PSF coupling, spaxel sampling, IFU image-slicer
  remapping, spectral dispersion, detector noise, cube reconstruction, and
  SNR / line-flux / velocity / cross-talk diagnostics. A learning and portfolio
  project, not a calibrated instrument simulator.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Han"
    given-names: "Xu"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - integral-field spectroscopy
  - adaptive optics
  - spectrograph simulation
  - datacube
